From: MrUnforsaken
Date: 2026-05-25
Subject: [PATCH 0011] Add advanced/expert config infrastructure

Add all C++ structs, YAML parsing, Rust serde structs, and TypeScript interfaces for the advanced/expert settings section under methods.face.advanced.

Section structure:
  unsharp_mask: {enable, amount}
  ir_capture:   {warmup_frames, capture_timeout_ms, poll_interval_ms, max_attempts, agc_sleep_ms, camera_warmup_ms}
  capture:      {width, height, preview_fps}
  detection:    {input_size, nms_iou_threshold}
  anti_spoofing: {spoof_class, combinational_mode, debug_save_path}
  enrollment:   {capture_count}
  recognition:  {gallery_path}
  auth:         {max_time_ms}

Also adds getMaxAuthTimeMs() virtual to IAuthMethod.

